2026-07-08 15:14:51,632 | AGENT | TechnicalArchitect Agent answered: To meet the client's requirements, I propose a technical architecture centered around our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. The platform will be hosted on OuraneCloud's Sovereign tier, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, EU-only, and renewable-powered, ensuring high security and compliance standards for confidential financial data.

The Atelier platform will be deployed with Kubernetes containerisation to ensure scalability and ease of management. Its model-agnostic design allows us to select the most suitable model option based on performance requirements. For daily professional use, I recommend using the Sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, which offers fully sovereign, auditable, and strong grounding/citation behaviour.

To integrate with the required business tools, we will leverage our API-first design (REST + webhook) and utilize connectors and adapters for accounting-production software, payroll software, document-management systems (GED), and electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environment. Our delivery partner, Ligeo Conseil, will assist in ensuring seamless integration.

